{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234390","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14234390","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1423439001:1":{"text":"꼬마 아가씨! 저희가 도와줄게요. 무슨 일인가요?","source_cn":"小姑娘，我们有什么能帮到你的地方吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D06636FBDDD9334","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423439002:1":{"text":"모모가 없어졌어요... 모모가 없어졌다고요!","source_cn":"我的咪咪不见了……咪咪找不到了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA6FB4FBA5B37D55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423439003:1":{"text":"모모가 엄마 아빠 대신 제 곁에 있어 줄 거라고 생각했는데... 모모, 너마저 날 버리는 거야...?","source_cn":"我以为咪咪会代替爸爸妈妈陪着我的，咪咪，连你也不要我了吗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85DEC0184F3255E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423439004:1":{"text":"아무래도 이 아이는 가족을 잃고 지금까지 \"모모\"라는 애완동물과 함께 지낸 모양이네요.","source_cn":"听上去这个小女孩失去了自己的家人，和一只叫“咪咪”的宠...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19480A298D8223D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423439005:1":{"text":"꼬마 아가씨, 그 모모는 어떻게 생겼어요?","source_cn":"小姑娘，你的咪咪长什么样子呀？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8312852939DF56BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423439006:1":{"text":"검정색에 귀가 뾰족해요...","source_cn":"黑色的、耳朵尖尖的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDCB5A33BE793D4E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1423439007:1":{"text":"아, 켓시군요! 얼른 찾아봐요!","source_cn":"原来是小法妖呀！我们帮她找找吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB148D3B8A76556C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:哭泣的平民女孩":{"text":"울고 있는 평민 소녀","source":"哭泣的平民女孩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":2}}